1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,400
A rant about my mother-in-law, meant for my husband,
went to the in-laws' group chat.

2
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:04,200
In-laws, sister-in-law, husband.
All 4 have read it.

3
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:06,150
Typing

4
00:00:06,150 --> 00:00:09,650
Mother-in-law is typing a long message

5
00:00:09,650 --> 00:00:12,050
Then, the cafe owner

6
00:00:12,150 --> 00:00:14,050
What would your mother-in-law want to block her ears from?

7
00:00:14,050 --> 00:00:15,650
The cafe owner's one move

8
00:00:15,650 --> 00:00:16,950
Me: Mother, what do you most want to block your ears from?

9
00:00:16,950 --> 00:00:18,150
Mother-in-law: Your father-in-law's snoring.
She was blocking her ears too.

10
00:00:18,150 --> 00:00:19,050
Sister-in-law: Me too, Dad's snoring.

11
00:00:19,050 --> 00:00:20,050
Husband: Me too.

12
00:00:20,050 --> 00:00:22,600
Only father-in-law didn't know

13
00:00:22,660 --> 00:00:24,310
Was I the only one who didn't know?

14
00:00:24,350 --> 00:00:26,050
Mother-in-law renamed the chat:
Dad's Snoring Task Force

15
00:00:26,050 --> 00:00:27,550
Mother-in-law: Earplugs are on me. Daughter-in-law first.

16
00:00:29,380 --> 00:00:31,130
One move from Hongchaksa, and you're set.

17
00:00:31,150 --> 00:00:34,150
You can't unsend it, but you can choose your next words.
Your move for 2027, hongchaksa.kr
